-- ANCHOR: all
-- 🧮 Floats at the edges: 1 / 0, the root of -1, and the ways of
--    showing a Float. Python raises an error for the first two, and
--    writes the others in its own way; Lam does neither.
-- 端の Float：1 / 0、-1 の平方根、Float の見せ方。Python は、はじめの
-- 2つで例外を出し、ほかは自分の形で書く。Lam は、どちらもしない
main = do
  print (1 / 0)
  print (sqrt (0 - 1))
  print [1.0, 0.1 + 0.2, 1.0e16, 0.0000001]
  print (-7 // 2, 2 * 10000000000 * 10000000000)
  putStrLn (Float.fixed 2 0.125)
-- ANCHOR_END: all
